                "uri": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHK-Lsi4GnEftTA-QZZnOuWWTzlT0t7wTWmqteVnxJSw5y8f5gumIVzFIfwvrntyhyup2I6jJr0ZB9C4AyyNOR5EVEQMEm4caufeXTLaHeg9A2JcJ7nz7AoRmSc49FPOaIdJPWJmf9JZD9hkAYX1SyDByhzeTFB0KjDSNjTl4_84HA4M6wIjHyzLlJ34D5ZZihylXnA5DfxBSh6hMeT5uWDA0i9KykcxM5IB4g="
